# Opt-in worker egress allowlist example (ADR 0046 §5).
# Every entry in crew-egress.txt opens a direct outbound channel from the
# isolated crew container to that host:port (data can leave to an account on
# that host). Keep crew-egress.txt absent when dependencies are vendored or
# pre-cached; copy to crew-egress.txt and uncomment only required registries.
# Format: lowercase host:port, no wildcards, no IP literals.
#
# Python package index:
# pypi.org:443
# files.pythonhosted.org:443
#
# JavaScript / TypeScript registry:
# registry.npmjs.org:443
#
# Rust crates index:
# crates.io:443
# static.crates.io:443
# index.crates.io:443
#
# Java / Kotlin Maven & Gradle repositories:
# repo.maven.apache.org:443
# services.gradle.org:443
# plugins.gradle.org:443
